  "releaseNotes": "0.9.9.0 — Welcome Screen redesign (#138): animated startup panel, recent files list, quick-action tiles, themed header; Diff tab + Timeline tab freeze fix (layout pass debounce on tab switch); default ActivePanelHighlight changed to Glow; localization StaticResource fixes across 5 panels. 0.9.8.0 — UpdateOverlay retry bounded; EagerContentKey bypass; overlay alignment fix; Threads + Parallel Stacks panels; WorkspaceFindReplace redesign; +10 languages (28 total). 0.9.7.0 — Tab horizontal reorder; tab-switch perf; StaticResource labels; full localization.",
